---
layout: layouts/product.njk
title: "Infrastructure & uptime"
description: "VoiceTel network infrastructure: colocation facilities, cloud regions, carrier handoffs, redundancy, status visibility, and the voice availability target."
---
{%- from "partials/v2/macros.njk" import arrow %}

<section class="hero hero--page" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
	<div class="hero__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<div class="container hero__inner">
		<div class="hero__copy">
			<p class="eyebrow">Infrastructure</p>
			<h1 id="hero-heading">Network facts without inflated claims.</h1>
			<p class="lede">Six colocation POPs across North America and Europe, plus three cloud regions. Anycast and Geocast routing options. STIR/SHAKEN signing at the edge. 99.99% availability target measured monthly, with the SLA written in plain English.</p>
			<div class="cta-row">
				<a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/status/">View status {{ arrow(14) }}</a>
				<a class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg" href="/signup/">Free trial</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="hero__visual">
			{%- set kpis = [
				{ label: "Colocation POPs", value: (colocations | length), sub: (site.pops | join(" · ")) },
				{ label: "Cloud regions", value: (cloudRegions | length), sub: (site.cloudRegions | join(" · ")) },
				{ label: "Availability target", value: "99.99", suffix: "%", sub: "Measured monthly. SLA written in plain English." },
				{ label: "Edge signing", value: "STIR/SHAKEN", sub: "Anycast and Geocast routing options" }
			] %}
			{% include "partials/v2/kpi-grid.njk" %}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint" id="colocation" aria-labelledby="colocation-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="section__head">
			<p class="eyebrow">Colocation facilities</p>
			<h2 id="colocation-heading">Six colocation POPs across North America and Europe, with published compliance and uptime per facility.</h2>
			<p class="lede">Facility addresses, compliance programs, and the 1000-day uptime measured for every POP.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="table-container">
			<table class="data-table">
				<thead>
					<tr><th scope="col">POP</th><th scope="col">Facility</th><th scope="col">Compliance</th><th scope="col">Uptime, 1000 days</th></tr>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					{%- for c in colocations %}
					<tr>
						<td>{{ c.code }}</td>
						<td>{% if c.street %}{{ c.street }}, {% endif %}{{ c.city }}{% if c.region %}, {{ c.region }}{% endif %}{% if c.country %}, {{ c.country }}{% endif %}</td>
						<td>{% if c.compliance and c.compliance.length %}{{ c.compliance | join(", ") }}{% endif %}</td>
						<td>{% if c.statuscakeTrack %}<img src="https://app.statuscake.com/button/index.php?Track={{ c.statuscakeTrack }}&amp;Days=1000&amp;Design=1" width="200" height="40" alt="{{ c.code }} 1000-day uptime" loading="lazy">{% endif %}</td>
					</tr>
					{%- endfor %}
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--white" id="cloud" aria-labelledby="cloud-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row row--reverse">
			<div class="row__text">
				<p class="eyebrow">Cloud regions</p>
				<h2 id="cloud-heading">Three cloud regions extend the colocation footprint.</h2>
				<p class="lede">Two East Coast regions and one West Coast region back the colocation POPs: a primary, a secondary for redundancy and Midwest backhaul, and a Pacific-time disaster-recovery anchor adjacent to SJC.</p>
				<p class="row__links">Uptime percentages are calculated and displayed by <a href="https://www.statuscake.com/" rel="external">StatusCake</a>.</p>
				<div class="cta-row">
					<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/status/">Network status</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="row__visual">
				<div class="table-container">
					<table class="data-table">
						<thead>
							<tr><th scope="col">Region</th><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Uptime, 1000 days</th></tr>
						</thead>
						<tbody>
							{%- for r in cloudRegions %}
							<tr>
								<td>{{ r.label }}<span class="data-table__meta">{{ r.awsCode }}</span></td>
								<td>{{ r.geo }}</td>
								<td>{% if r.statuscakeTrack %}<img src="https://app.statuscake.com/button/index.php?Track={{ r.statuscakeTrack }}&amp;Days=1000&amp;Design=1" width="200" height="40" alt="{{ r.label }} 1000-day uptime" loading="lazy">{% endif %}</td>
							</tr>
							{%- endfor %}
						</tbody>
					</table>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="cta-band">
			<div class="cta-band__text">
				<h3 class="cta-band__title">Need procurement-ready details?</h3>
				<p class="cta-band__body">Route security, redundancy, SLA, and network-design questions through the contact path so support can provide account-appropriate documentation.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cta-band__actions cta-row">
				<a class="btn btn--primary" href="/signup/">Try for free {{ arrow(14) }}</a>
				<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/contact/">Contact us</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
